=== layout: one-panel

# Linkage Changes the Class Counts

@body

- Genes on different chromosomes: [PD]{color=#935D00} and [NPD]{color=#007A00} are approximately equal.
- Linked genes: [PD]{color=#935D00} is much greater than [NPD]{color=#007A00}.
- [TT]{color=#A719DB} alone does not establish whether the genes are linked.
- Unlinked genes can also give [TT]{color=#A719DB}; we will see how later.

